<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{asset "styles/css/partials/store-faq.css"}}"/>

<div class="store-faq-container post-body godo-canvas font-serif">
    <h3 id="FAQ">
        Frequently Asked Questions
    </h3>
    <div class="store-faq">
        <details>
            <summary>
                Are the prints and digital images watermarked?
            </summary>
            <p>
                The watermark is for display purposes only on the website. When you receive your digital or physical print, the watermark and branding will be removed.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>
                What kind of license does the digital image come with?
            </summary>
            <p>
                The digital images will be sent with a Personal Use Digital Image license, which means the image can be used for a variety of your own personal uses, but cannot be sold, or used for commercial purposes.
            </p>
            <p>
                If you need a license for advertising, book, documentary or extended usage, <strong>please <a href="mailto:{{@custom.store_contact_email}}">contact ElleB Photography</a> for a custom commercial license.</strong>
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>
                Will the physical prints look exactly like how I see them on my screen?
            </summary>
            <p>
                Due to monitors, phones, tablets, etc. having different resolutions, colors may vary slightly from what you see on your screen and what you receive.
            </p>
        </details>
    </div>
</div>